flowchart TD
    A[SkinState + User Constraints + Product Evidence] --> B[Evidence Validation]
    B --> C{Critical evidence missing?}
    C -->|Yes| U[Unknown / confidence penalty]
    C -->|No| D[Hard Constraint Engine]
    U --> D
    D --> E{Conflict?}
    E -->|Yes| X[Ineligible]
    E -->|No| F[Soft Preference Scoring]
    F --> G[Evidence Completeness Weight]
    G --> H[Rank Candidates]
    H --> I{Sufficient evidence and margin?}
    I -->|No| J[Abstain / low confidence]
    I -->|Yes| K[Winner + Reason Codes]
    K --> R[Decision Receipt]
    X --> R
    J --> R
